# Changelog

## 2026.08.15

- Support Duplicacy repositories on Dropbox independently from optional rclone mirrors.
- Support repository-root overrides such as `/mnt/user/immich/backups`.
- Preserve configured targets while a dataset is paused.
- Monitor isolated Immich and iCloud Dropbox repositories accurately.
- Show a pending state instead of contradictory 0% protected output when coverage is unavailable.
- Prevent concurrent coverage collectors from corrupting their shared cache.
- Label active Duplicacy transfers with the correct cloud provider.
- Update the default schedule summary for core, Immich, and iCloud backups.
